  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole organism, two tall curved horns rising from rear frill. Not skull-only. [\"Skull-based fossil, body shape/tail/skin/colour inferred, not a complete fossil skeleton.\", \"Restore bilateral missing anatomy; bone openings covered by living tissues, no open windows through living frill.\", \"Museum dates79.5Ma versus UGS82Ma differ; retain Late Cretaceous Campanian without overprecise time.\"] {\"primary_anchor\": \"Original2007 discoverers report beak-to-frill about1m, paired spines add0.5m, brow horns0.25m. Confirm photograph10cm scale.\", \"body_length_target_m\": 4.5, \"body_length_status\": \"Explicit modelling estimate, not measured whole specimen. Body inferred from related quadrupedal ceratopsids.\", \"conflict\": \"Modern UGS summary says4.5ft beak-to-frill versus2007 original1m; use original authors metric and true scale image, not false precision.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole organism, two tall curved horns rising from rear frill. Not skull-only. [\"Skull-based fossil, body shape/tail/skin/colour inferred, not a complete fossil skeleton.\", \"Restore bilateral missing anatomy; bone openings covered by living tissues, no open windows through living frill.\", \"Museum dates79.5Ma versus UGS82Ma differ; retain Late Cretaceous Campanian without overprecise time.\"] {\"primary_anchor\": \"Original2007 discoverers report beak-to-frill about1m, paired spines add0.5m, brow horns0.25m. Confirm photograph10cm scale.\", \"body_length_target_m\": 4.5, \"body_length_status\": \"Explicit modelling estimate, not measured whole specimen. Body inferred from related quadrupedal ceratopsids.\", \"conflict\": \"Modern UGS summary says4.5ft beak-to-frill versus2007 original1m; use original authors metric and true scale image, not false precision.\"}"
  },
